{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01966","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 一去无还意 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 一去无还意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良人征绝域，一去不言还。\n百战攻胡虏，三冬阻玉关。\n萧萧边马思，猎猎戍旗闲。\n独把千重恨，连年未解颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}